        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>So I want to make sure we followed the rules correctly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We were playing in Freedom Tower Map, Wraith Pops into Level 3 With---</p><p><strong>Slip into shadows</strong>: The first time the wraith would be attacked each turn, she may sprint. Then resolve that attack. (If the attack is now impossible, the attack misses.)</p><p>Ra is at her 2 O clock With--</p><p><strong>Blazing Tornado</strong> at her 5 O Clock.</p><p><strong>Living Pyre:</strong> Ra Generates Hazard Spaces.</p><p>The Operative is at her 10 O Clock with&mdash;</p><p><strong>Hidden Blast Strike:</strong> The Operative Generates Hazard Spaces for Enemies.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The book Defines and attack as:</p><p align=\"center\"><strong>ATTACK: AN ACTION OR ABILITY THAT HAS THE ATTACK DIE CODE.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So we Ruled that The Wraith would sprint one square forward, activating Ra&rsquo;s and The Operative&rsquo;s 2<sup>nd</sup> Hazzard Space. Because this is the 2<sup>nd</sup> attack, she has to resolve this, then continue her Sprint forward then resolve the first attack which now misses.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Is this Correct??</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
        "admin": false,
        "staff": false,
        "user_id": 11055,
        "hidden": false,
        "trust_level": 1,
