      {
        "id": 159373,
        "name": "RySmith6",
        "username": "RySmith6",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rysmith6/{size}/1852_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-08T20:07:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes. As far as I understand your setup(The Wraith teleports&nbsp;<em>into</em> the hazard spaces, triggering stuff), whatever she triggers during the Slip Into Shadows sprint is still a valid attack, and can therefore incap her. A SIS Wraith can definiely die if they have to sprint through hazards.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:39:40.042Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 1,
