        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Yes. As far as I understand your setup(The Wraith teleports&nbsp;<em>into</em> the hazard spaces, triggering stuff), whatever she triggers during the Slip Into Shadows sprint is still a valid attack, and can therefore incap her. A SIS Wraith can definiely die if they have to sprint through hazards.</p>",
